{"version":1,"key":"card:305","content":{"id":305,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"prettier","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是一个代码格式化工具，它的目的是让人们不在为代码风格而进行争辩，因此它提供了很少的选项去配置代码风格（否则人们又会为代码风格进行争论，离它的目标不符）。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"081f4d60-c0c6-4e12-89f4-2cd784564c0e","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"安装","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a19819d6-ac99-4aab-b750-8d873dc5ce95","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"npm install prettier --save-dev --save-exact","collabId":"fce9b59e-33b0-4403-b7e5-76577000b974","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"4e487756-f161-45ef-b21a-0b7bb87cfa16","language":"shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"98c377f4-8321-4896-aa53-a867ae68fcb3"},{"children":[{"text":"使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"—save-exact","type":"formatted"},{"text":"选项指示下载精确固定的版本，而不是符合语义化的版本，因为即使是小版本的不同，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"prettier","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 格式化的代码也可能有区分，因此确保大家用的都是同一版本，否则合并时可能会有冲突。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e220cd00-b220-4e1c-b1f5-0c9ba13778a6","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在项目的根目录下创建 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"prettier","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的配置文件，虽然提供的选项很少，但由于历史原因，还是提供了一些选项进行配置。","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"prettier","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 提供了很多种方式进行配置：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"02786633-2f5a-4203-92a2-57679f87568d","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"package.json","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"prettier","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 字段","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b0ece7e7-0a0a-4f6b-914e-3c795e1a3929","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"f46a6fdc-feba-4edc-8c8b-eb22636d7419","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":".prettierrc","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"61c089c8-56f9-4c6d-b9f1-3b226bcd77a5","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"1485c343-c7fb-41d5-8c98-88a286bfdd6a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":".prettierrc.json(5)/.prettierrc.y(a)ml","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5bd396c7-6447-40f8-afb1-9469b8db5941","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"f7fb6e35-e6be-4ae5-8d72-fe6b47a661b2","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":".prettierrc.js","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cd690b33-6520-49a4-a8c9-ee69209bd328","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"42c2f7c6-d06c-4ebe-97a6-84eda115d5b0","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"...","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e9447d11-4cb4-487f-be8e-29b80d7c17ef","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"7949a218-f7d7-4b07-b1a7-d592c9ee8b13","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"c